From: dianqk <dianqk@dianqk.net>
Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] power: supply: port Xiaomi battery and keyboard services

Porting notes: Apply fork Xiaomi battery extensions as hunks on the 7.3 battmgr driver and public header.

Detect the Xiaomi battery protocol only on the Sheng machine after matching the upstream SM8550 PMIC GLINK compatible.

Original author dates, messages, and trailers: patches/ORIGINS.md.
Source-Commit: https://github.com/ianchb/sm8550-mainline/commit/da1e6f1f17dbb0117de399c9544899bf1bcdf9cb
